The map in this repository's releases is a derivative database of
OpenStreetMap and is licensed under the Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0.

    Map data © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0.
    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Bathymetry is derived from GEBCO 2026 (British Oceanographic Data Centre),
free to use with the source named.

Population and employment figures come from Rosstat, the 2020 Russian census
and Petrostat, official statistics published for free use. ATTRIBUTION.md
lists every source with the address it was taken from.

The text of the README files is by SindieFox.
